# /scoreboard players tag 的持有者解析。
#
# 2026-10-21 实测：add / remove 的持有者解析不出实体时报
# "Entity 'Steve' cannot be found"。这一轮问两个还没测过的：
#   - list 分支的持有者解析不出时说什么
#   - remove 一个实体没有的标签时说什么
#
# 2026-10-21 实测：
#   - list 分支的持有者解析不出时**也**报 "Entity 'Steve' cannot be found"
#   - add / remove 同样报
#   - 实体没有标签时，list 什么都不说
#   - remove 一个实体没有的标签 -> "Entity didn't have the <标签> tag"

--- console ---
say S01
scoreboard players tag Steve list
say S02
scoreboard players tag Steve add marked
say S03
scoreboard players tag Steve remove marked
say S04
summon armor_stand 0 4 0 {CustomName:"TAG_AS"}
say S05
scoreboard players tag @e[type=armor_stand] list
say S06
scoreboard players tag @e[type=armor_stand] remove nothere
say S07
scoreboard players tag @e[type=armor_stand] add marked
say S08
scoreboard players tag @e[type=armor_stand] list
say S09
